	quest.2D2A55025036E882.quest_desc: [
		"There are a lot of cooking recipes in this modpack. Even before you make meals, you may need to craft condiments, stock, dough, cookware or other materials before you can make a certain recipe."
		""
		"In order to make your life easier, remember to use the &dEMI system&r to look at what you can make!"
		""
		"- If you write &#FFC3F0@pam&r, &#FFC3F0@farm&r or &#FFC3F0#c:foods&r, you'll see different food items, blocks and recipes that you can either make or use in recipes."
		""
		"- Try entering each tag one at a time, because they might have different results. What shows up in &#FFC3F0@pam&r might not show up in &#FFC3F0#c:foods&r."
		""
		"- Use the EMI to explore. Press 'R' over recipes/other things to see how to craft them, or 'U' over items (such as an onion) to see what they're used in!"
	]
	quest.2DFF8B4E5F44984C.quest_desc: [
		"You don't need every single ingredient to cook. Some recipes can be made with various ingredients!"
		""
		"For example, &#FFC3F0Veggie Strips&r can be made with nearly any &#DAFFB5Pam's&r vegetable."
		""
		"Also, you can make &#FFC3F0oil&r with different types of &#DAFFB5Pam's&r vegetables or nuts - also, canola."
		""
		"For meat and dairy, you can use &#FFC3F0soybeans&r to create soy milk, or silken/firm tofu. These can often be used to replace meat in a lot of recipes."
		""
		"Here are some soybean seeds. Try planting them!"
	]
	quest.2E4B6C6452EA0FDA.quest_desc: [
