	quest.3A74C10A3A179B08.quest_desc: [
		"The &eFire Brick&r is the basis for all foundry components. You'll need a bunch of them."
		""
		"The next quests guides you to create a basic 5x5x2 foundry, for which you need &6&n74&r fire bricks&r in total. You can of course make it any size you want, but I wouldn't recommend making it much smaller than this."
		""
		"You can also &zdye&r the components any color you want! For the quests however, you need the basic black variants."
