	quest.4651FB87F1404B7B.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &#DAFFB5Cooking for Blockheads&r! This is a mod that automatically connects your stored cooking ingredients to a &dspecial cooking crafting menu&r. It has a system that detects what recipes you have the ingredients for and automatically offers those recipes for crafting. No more going between chests or checking recipes!"
		""
		"To start, you'll need to make a &dCooking Table&r. The recipe for the Cooking Table requires &#FFC3F0two diamonds&r somewhere along the way, but we'll make it easier for you. "
		""
		"If you noticed, you got a diamond earlier for completing Ingredient Management. "
		""
		"So you'll only need one more diamond (unless you used the other one already?)"
	]
	quest.4651FB87F1404B7B.title: "Cooking for Blockheads"
	quest.474C4B5D747587B5.quest_desc: ["Mix up every metal in the pack, pour it out on a flower and you'll have the magical &zGardenium&r ingot in your hand."]
	quest.4784C3C93D622FBD.quest_desc: ["This modpack was made with love, and so are many of the items. Can you build a &#FFB3F3Love Factory?&r"]
	quest.4784C3C93D622FBD.quest_subtitle: "Jag älskar mina små älsklingar, mannen. - Alma"
	quest.4784C3C93D622FBD.title: "True Love?"
	quest.4B99D51DE62FD0A0.quest_desc: ["The backbone of the storage network. &eAny storage blocks touching the connector&r (chests, drawers, even furnaces and other things) &ewill show up in the network.&r"]
