	quest.4FDE3A663E48AE24.quest_desc: ["&eTom's Simple Storage&r is, as the name suggests, a simple &estorage solution&r. It can be set up very early and last pretty much the entire game. It centralizes your storage so you can access it from one location, instead of having to look around multiple chests."]
