	quest.5505D2F33DCA2D4D.quest_desc: [
		"With the amount of loot you will find on your travels a &ebackpack&r becomes a must. The backpacks follow the same upgrade system as tools and armor, but only with the vanilla materials."
		""
		"You can equip your backpack in the &eback slot&r in the &eaccessories screen&r."
