	quest.573A52ED113737F7.quest_desc: [
		"Applied Energistics 2 (AE2) let's you setup a so called \"Material-Energy System\" (&dME-system&r). Same as Tom's Simple Storage, this allows you to centralize your item storage."
		""
		"AE2 is more complicated to setup, but in return has some additional features like:"
		""
		"- Store items and fluids on hard drives (&ddisks&r)"
		"- &dAutocrafting&r"
		"- &dExporting&r and &dimporting&r items from machines and storages."
		""
		"This questline will guide step by step how to get started. AE2 is simplified in this pack and requires a fraction of the power and doesn't use channels like normal."
	]
	quest.573B0E131C759B02.quest_desc: ["The fuel tank for the foundry. It needs lava for the foundry to work, which you can insert with a bucket or pipes."]
	quest.57735F8C61011FF6.quest_desc: ["Small multiblock to create some alloyed metals. Just slap the metals you want and some coal and it will run!"]
	quest.57735F8C61011FF6.title: "Alloy Kiln"
